[I] GNU Virtual Private Ethernet

[T] GVPE (GNU Virtual Private Ethernet) is a suite providing a virtual
[T] private network for multiple nodes over an untrusted network. It creates
[T] a fully meshed encrypted VPN between nodes with various transport
[T] protocols such as UDP, TCP, raw IP, ICMP and DNS.

[U] http://software.schmorp.de/pkg/gvpe.html

[A] Gvpe Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

